      "text": "<!-- LOGICAL_PAGE_1_START -->\n[supplied: The right half of the first spread: the front page. A masthead across the top.]\n\n# THE PLACEHOLDER LEAFLET\n\n*No. 3 — Spring*\n\n### WELCOME\n\nThis leaflet is folded from one sheet. Its pages are printed out of order and read in order once folded. — THE EDITORS.\n\n<!-- LOGICAL_PAGE_1_END -->\n"
