      "text": "<!-- LOGICAL_PAGE_2_START -->\n### A WALK TO THE LIGHTHOUSE\n\nThe path leaves the harbour wall and climbs past the old rope works. \\[Note: printed in the source, in brackets.\\] From the top the lighthouse is in view.\n\n*(continued on page 3)*\n\n2\n<!-- LOGICAL_PAGE_2_END -->\n"
