      "text": "<!-- LOGICAL_PAGE_3_START -->\n### THE LIGHTHOUSE (continued from page 2)\n\nThe keeper shows visitors the lamp room on fine afternoons. — JANE DOE.\n\n3\n<!-- LOGICAL_PAGE_3_END -->\n"
